WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,520
The dynasty is coming, the world is falling

2
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:11,230
What do you want to do if you tie yourself up?

3
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:13,570
What do you think I want to do?

4
00:00:13,570 --> 00:00:14,530
Are you sick?

5
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:18,180
It’s already this time and I’m still thinking about this. Let me count to three.

6
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:21,020
If you dare to touch me, I will die.

7
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:26,330
You have to stretch out your hand even if you regret it

8
00:00:26,530 --> 00:00:32,810
you are still not a man

9
00:00:32,810 --> 00:00:34,970
I'm just bruised so shut up

10
00:00:35,650 --> 00:00:37,210
I don’t know what kind of scratch it is.

11
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:41,030
The rooftop is so big that you can’t escape and it’s not cheap.

12
00:00:42,090 --> 00:00:45,120
When I find something to eat, it will be cheaper to share it with you.

13
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:47,120
Don't blame me for blowing your head off now

14
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:49,440
You just want to keep things to yourself

15
00:00:50,770 --> 00:00:52,090
If it weren't for this roll of tape

16
00:00:52,610 --> 00:00:53,970
You are already downstairs now

17
00:00:59,170 --> 00:01:12,580
My name is Pan Ya, my junior classmate, Su Hao, my junior classmate.

18
00:01:12,900 --> 00:01:24,140
I'm sorry. It's okay. Just go and relax. Take it easy, senior sister.
